        "r": 148.472,
        "b": 580.9279068359375
      },
      "content": " generator set"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0051",
      "reading_order": 53,
      "section": "ABOUT THIS MANUAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 47.5657,
        "t": 568.3636068359375,
        "r": 291.3895000000001,
        "b": 546.3161492035388
      },
      "content": "See the Engine Service Manual for engine information."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0052",
      "reading_order": 54,
      "section": "ABOUT THIS MANUAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 47.565699999999964,
        "t": 532.9876068359375,
        "r": 291.5908,
        "b": 486.6191492035388
      },
      "content": "Study this manual carefully.  Heed all warnings and cautions.  Proper use and maintenance can result in longer set life, better  performance  and  safer operation."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0053",
      "reading_order": 55,
      "section": "ABOUT THIS MANUAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 47.56569999999998,
        "t": 473.2906068359376,
        "r": 291.57759999999973,
        "b": 414.7902492035389
      },
      "content": "This  manual contains basic wiring diagrams and schematics for troubleshooting. Technicians should  use  the  wiring  diagram  and  schematic shipped with each unit.  Update these diagrams and schematics when the set is modified."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0054",
      "reading_order": 56,
      "section": "ABOUT THIS MANUAL",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 47.56569999999998,
        "t": 401.46170683593766,
        "r": 291.75690000000003,
        "b": 367.28234920353896
      },
      "content": "PC board information is limited; in the field, it is more efficient  to  replace  the  boards  than  to  attempt repair."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0055",
